    "What is the objective of this production plan — for example, maximize the number of complete products (each requiring one unit of each of the three components) that can be assembled, or maximize total profit, or something else?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the optimization objective, presenting examples but requiring one specific answer."
}

