    "Are there any demand limits or minimum production requirements for the components or complete products, or is the only limit the workshop capacity (i.e., produce as many complete products as the workshops allow)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the nature of production constraints (demand/minimums vs. capacity only)."
}

